items.source:
Orcs! Ah! Well then this is your lucky day. This whole continent is swarming with Orcs. They have united as the Orc Pride and, according to rumour, their masters are powerful.
They roam the lands freely, ever assaulting us.
@playername@, you have helped one of ours. I grant you access to the Gates of Morning and name you friend of the Sunwall.

items.target:
兽人！啊！那今天可真是你的幸运日。整片大陆到处都是兽人。他们联合组成了兽人部落，据传言，他们背后的主人十分强大。
他们在这片土地上肆意游荡，不断袭击我们。
@playername@，你帮助了我们的一位同胞。我准许你进入晨曦之门，并封你为太阳堡垒之友。

items.source:
#VIOLET#*As you open the door you notice a huge orc in the distance, covered in both flames and ice.*#LAST#
@playerdescriptor.race@! You should never have come! Your doom awaits!
The Orc Pride will never yield to anybody! They have their precious and there is nothing you can do.

items.target:
#VIOLET#*当你打开门，你注意到远处一个巨大的兽人，周身同时被烈焰与寒冰笼罩。*#LAST#
@playerdescriptor.race@！你根本不该来这里！你的死期到了！
兽人部落绝不会向任何人屈服！他们已经拿到了至宝，你什么也做不了！
